// MK9-S1-M1 (roadmap B-1): a user module's own "extern fun", bound to a
// native symbol through this project's coral.toml '[extern."ctype"]'
// section. "toupper" is the native symbol, and its `header = "ctype.h"` key
// is what the generated C includes for its prototype.
pub extern fun toupper(c: i32).R: i32
